    "reviews": "\u201cIf you\u2019re up for the challenge, then Barbearian has a chaotic, yet rewarding adventure ahead of you.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 PC Invasion<br><br>\u201c...makes you feel like you're in the center of a carnage pinata\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Boomstick Gaming<br><br>\u201cWith over 100 levels to battle through, plenty of loot to collect, numerous bosses to take down and even some prisoners to rescue, Barbearian will keep even the most seasoned of adventurers very busy and highly entertained for quite some time.\u201d<br>95/100 \u2013 Pure Nintendo<br>",
